UPDATE companies SET description='Bernman Mold & Engineering Inc. has operated as a family-owned business in Ontario, California since 1994. The company traces its roots to Manuel J. Solorio Sr., who founded a precision mold manufacturing shop in Upland, California. After more than two decades at that location, the operation moved to a 7,000-square-foot facility in Ontario, where Solorio''s son, Manuel A. Solorio Jr., now serves as owner.

