UPDATE companies SET description='Black Wolf Design was founded in 1996 by Terry Sweeney in Omro, Wisconsin. Sweeney''s passion for woodworking was inspired by his grandfather, a master craftsman, and the company began as a small shop dedicated to creating heirloom-quality custom furniture for elite interior designers.

