UPDATE companies SET description='Blue Horizon Energy was founded in 2009 in Plymouth, Minnesota, as a full-service clean energy development company. The firm began by helping homeowners and small businesses adopt solar power and has since expanded to serve complex energy projects across the Midwest. Leadership includes CEO Griffin Dooling and a senior team overseeing revenue, development, construction, and service operations.

