n, siding, painting, commercial roofing, drywall -> page ''/''", "Operates in nine states across multiple cities -> page ''/''", "Owens Corning Platinum Preferred Contractor -> page ''/''", "CertainTeed ShingleMaster Select Contractor -> page ''/''", "Limited lifetime warranty on workmanship and manufacturer defects -> page ''/''", "Maintenance plan includes monthly monitoring and annual 10-point inspection -> page ''/''", "Free estimates for all services -> page ''/''", "Serves homeowners and commercial properties -> page ''/''"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Bone Dry Solar helps homeowners harness the power of the sun to generate clean, renewable energy and reduce their reliance on traditional fossil fuels. Our team of experts specializes in designing and installing customized solar energy systems that meet the unique needs and preferences of each homeowner.", "founded_year": "1989", "employee_count": "500", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bone-dry-solar' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Boston Medical Products Inc. is headquartered in Shrewsbury, Massachusetts. The company was founded in 1980 by three physicians, among them the world-surgeon William W. Montgomery, M.D., to bring Dr. Montgomery''s original airway and surgical innovations to a broader physician audience. The venture began as a vehicle to commercialize the Montgomery® brand of tracheal and bronchial devices.

The firm manufactures a focused line of ENT surgical and respiratory products. Its portfolio includes the Standard and Thoracic Safe‑T‑Tube® series, ROTEPS rotatable bronchoscopy forceps, DUMON silicone airway stents, the DUTAU NOVATECH modular bronchoscope system, TONN NOVATECH stent applicators, SURVAC atraumatic suction catheters, and STERITALC® sterile talc for pleurodesis. Production takes place in a clean‑room environment, and the company manages electronic labelling (e‑labelling) for instructions for use.

The company notes that product availability may vary by country and directs international inquiries to its contact team. It participates in major medical meetings such as AAO‑HNSF, CHEST, and the Winter Days of Laryngology.

