UPDATE companies SET description='Bucks 4x4 was founded in 1966 in Boise, Idaho, as a family-owned business now in its third generation. It began as a mechanic shop serving the off-road community and has since expanded into a full-line retailer of off-road parts and accessories.

The company operates a complete mechanic shop staffed by experts in gears, driveshafts, lifts, tires, and wheels. In addition to selling components such as bumpers, axles, differentials, and transfer cases from brands like Addictive Desert Designs, Air Lift, KC HiLiTES, and ARB, Bucks 4x4 builds custom 4x4 vehicles, offering everything from individual parts to complete Moab-Ready builds.

Its customers are primarily off-road enthusiasts and recreational 4x4 owners, along with dealers who source parts through a dedicated dealer program. The shop serves the automotive aftermarket for four-wheel-drive vehicles, providing installation services for suspension systems, drivetrain components, and tire-and-wheel packages.

The company emphasizes its roots as off-roaders themselves, stating they adapt to meet the community''s needs. Their motto, BUCKS BUILT, reflects pride in every vehicle they work on, whether it''s a simple parts order or a full custom build.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Vehicle repair and maintenance", "Custom 4x4 vehicle builds", "Off-road parts installation", "Drivetrain and differential service", "Suspension and lift kit installation", "Tire and wheel mounting and balancing", "Driveshaft fabrication and repair", "Parts retail and distribution", "Dealer parts program"], "industries": ["Off-road automotive", "Automotive aftermarket", "4x4 vehicle customization", "Recreational off-roading"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated for three generations", "Complete mechanic shop offering installation and custom builds", "Extensive inventory of off-road parts and accessories from leading brands", "Specialized expertise in gears, driveshafts, lifts, tires, and wheels", "Offers complete Moab-Ready vehicle builds"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1966 -> db", "Family-owned, third generation -> /", "Location Boise, Idaho -> db", "Complete mechanic shop -> /", "Extensive assortment of off-road accessories -> /", "Expertise in gears, driveshafts, lifts, tires, wheels -> /", "Moab-Ready Builds -> /", "Brands carried: Addictive Desert Designs, Air Lift, KC HiLiTES, Rough Country, Yukon Gear, ARB, ULTRAHOOK -> /", "Categories: Accessories, Bumpers Skid Plates Armor, Driveshafts, Drivetrain, Lift Kits & Suspension, Tires & Wheels -> /", "Dealer and customer signup -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "unclear", "type_evidence": "From a complete mechanic shop to an extensive assortment of off-road accessories.", "founded_year": "1966", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ow