UPDATE companies SET description='Bueno Foods operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico, where it has been producing New Mexican chile-based foods for multiple decades—now in its seventh decade of business. The company traces its roots to family recipes, notably Grandma Filomena’s original tortilla recipe, though no founding year or founder names are publicly disclosed.

The manufacturer produces a range of shelf-stable and frozen items, including Hatch and Autumn Roast® green chile, red chile, salsas, sauces, chile powders, Grandma’s® flour tortillas, and a variety of tamales and enchiladas (pork, chicken, beef, cheese, and vegan). Products are sold through retail grocery channels such as Albertsons and direct to consumers via an online store that ships nationwide.

Bueno Foods serves retail grocery chains, independent grocers, and e-commerce customers across the United States. The company emphasizes its connection to New Mexico’s Hatch and Rio Grande valleys for chile sourcing.

The company highlights its SQF (Safe Quality Food) certification, having achieved “Excellent & Exceptional” ratings in independent audits, as proof of its food safety and quality commitments. It also promotes its efforts to preserve New Mexico’s green chile crop and to deliver authentic, homemade taste rooted in family tradition.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Green chile processing (Hatch, Autumn Roast\u00ae)", "Salsa and sauce production", "Tortilla manufacturing (Grandma\u2019s\u00ae recipe)", "Tamale and enchilada production", "Chile powder production", "Frozen food packaging and shipping"], "industries": ["Retail grocery", "E-commerce", "Foodservice"], "materials": ["Hatch green chile", "New Mexico red chile", "Autumn Roast\u00ae green chile", "Pork", "Chicken", "Beef", "Cheese", "Blue corn", "Flour"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Authentic New Mexican heritage and family recipes (Grandma Filomena\u2019s tortillas)", "SQF Excellent & Exceptional certification for food safety and quality", "Direct-to-consumer online shipping nationwide", "Commitment to preserving New Mexico\u2019s green chile crop", "Chile supplier for regional foodservice events (Green Chile Cheeseburger Smackdown)"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Albuquerque, New Mexico -> db", "SQF certification -> db", "Seventh decade of operation -> /", "Grandma Filomena''s original tortilla recipe -> /", "Product lines: salsas, sauces, chile powders, tortillas, tamales, enchiladas -> /", "Online direct-to-consumer shipping -> /", "Retail distribution at Albertsons -> /", "Commitment to preserving New Mexico''s Green Chile crop -> /", "SQF Excellent & Exceptional category audit -> /", "Instagram handle @buenofoods -> /", "Autumn Roast\u00ae green chile product -> /", "Green Chile Cheeseburger Smackdown chile supplier -> /", "Blue corn red chile enchiladas recipe -> /", "Vegan tamales offered -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "At Bueno Foods, staying true to our New Mexican heritage is at the heart of all of our foods.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.instagram.com/buenofoods/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='bueno-foods' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Built by Newport has operated from Newport, Vermont since 1963. Originally known as NFP, the company rebranded to reflect its focus on handcrafted hardwood furniture. Over six decades, it has grown from a wood component supplier into a full-service manufacturer of dining chairs, accent tables, lounge seating, and lighting.

The shop combines sophisticated CNC technology with hand craftsmanship from experienced builders. Its capabilities span CAD design with 3D imagery, CNC production, BIFMA testing, upholstery, steel and metal accent integration, finishing, and packaging. The facility produces both complete furniture pieces and wood components for other manufacturers, working across all hardwood species.

The company serves established furniture brands and retailers, including Room & Board and Misewell. Its customer base consists of well-established firms in growing markets that require turnkey manufacturing services from concept through delivery. Wood component manufacturing remains a core service, harking back to the firm''s founding years.

Built by Newport emphasizes continuous improvement, blending modern technology with artisanal skill. The firm cites its ability to execute previously impossible designs through CNC innovation while maintaining hand-finishing quality. Turnkey services — from design validation to damage-free packaging — are positioned as its key differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC machining", "CAD design / 3D imagery", "BIFMA testing", "Upholstery", "Steel/metal accent integration", "Finishing", "Packaging", "Wood component manufacturing", "Hand assembly and craftsmanship"], "industries": ["Furniture manufacturing", "Wood component manufacturing", "Contract furniture manufacturing", "Retail furniture (OEM)"], "materials": ["Hardwoods (various species)"], "equipment": ["CNC machines", "CAD software"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Sophisticated CNC technology combined with hand craftsmanship", "Turnkey services from design through packaging", "BIFMA testing capabilities", "Work with all hardwood species", "Over 60 years of furniture manufacturing experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1963 in Newport, Vermont -> db", "Specializes in dining chairs, accent tables, lounge seating, lighting -> db and /", "Combines CNC technology with hand craftsmanship -> /", "Offers CAD design, BIFMA testing, upholstery, finishing, packaging -> /", "Serves Room & Board and Misewell -> /", "Wood component manufacturing service -> /", "Address: 450 Main St, Newport, VT -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "After more than 60 years in furniture manufacturing, Built by Newport has established itself as a leader in the hardwood furniture industry", "founded_year": "1963", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/11407805/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='built-by-newport' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='BABBCO, founded in 1918 by Charles Babb, is headquartered in Raynham, Massachusetts, near Boston. The company remains family-owned, now guided by fourth-generation leader William Foran, Charles Babb''s great-grandson. It began serving growing bakeries in the northeastern United States with a philosophy of asking customers what they want rather than telling them.

The company designs, builds, and delivers custom-crafted tunnel ovens and conveyors from a 75,000-square-foot manufacturing facility. It offers eight major types of industrial tunnel ovens—including direct-fired, indirect-fired, air impingement, infrared, radiant-tube, thermal-oil, electric, dual-fuel, and hybrid configurations—all built on a modular platform that simplifies configuration, installation, and future modification. An on-site Innovation Center allows customers to test products on BABBCO ovens before purchase. The product range also includes final proofers and complete turnkey baking systems.

BABBCO serves commercial bakeries of all sizes, from small wholesale operations to the largest globally recognized food brands. Its customer base spans the food processing industry, with installations worldwide.

The company''s founding principle—listening to customer needs—drives its reputation for providing oven solutions rather than just products. BABBCO emphasizes the combination of global technical resources with the flexibility and craftsmanship of a family business, investing continuously in new baking methods and technologies to improve quality, capacity, uptime, and environmental impact.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom tunnel oven design and manufacturing", "Custom conveyor manufacturing", "Final proofer manufacturing", "Turnkey baking system integration", "Modular oven design and configuration", "Innovation center product testing", "Oven installation and modification", "Multi-fuel oven engineering (natural gas, propane, oil, electric)"], "industries": ["Commercial bakeries", "Food manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Modular oven design for easy configuration and modification", "On-site Innovation Center for product testing before purchase", "Eight distinct tunnel oven types covering all major heating methods", "Family-owned since 1918 with four generations of leadership", "Custom-crafted ovens with no standard models"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1918 by Charles Babb -> /about", "Headquarters in Raynham, Massachusetts -> db", "75,000 sq ft manufacturing facility -> /about", "Family-owned, four generations, led by William Foran -> /about", "Designs and builds 8 types of custom tunnel ovens -> /", "Modular oven design -> /", "Innovation Center for testing -> /", "Serves bakeries from small wholesale to large food companies -> /", "Offers direct fired, indirect fired, air impingement, infrared, radiant-tube, thermal-oil, electric, dual-fuel, hybrid ovens -> /", "Custom conveyors, final proofers, turnkey baking systems -> /about", "Multi-fuel capability: natural gas, propane, oil, electricity -> /", "Philosophy: ask customers what they want -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "BABBCO designs, builds and delivers custom-crafted bakery tunnel ovens from our world class 75,000 square foot manufacturing facility near Boston, Massachusetts.", "founded_year": "1918", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/babbco-tunnel-ovens/"], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='c-h-babb-co-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='C Worth Superstore has operated as a restaurant supply store in Lexington, Kentucky, since 1954. The company serves as a one-stop shop for commercial kitchen and culinary needs across the state.

The business supplies a broad range of commercial kitchen equipment, including restaurant and bar supplies, catering equipment, commercial cooking equipment, commercial refrigeration and dishwashers, food preparation equipment, ice machines, smallwares, janitorial supplies, cutlery, and restaurant furniture. It also provides commercial kitchen design, delivery, installation, and lease-to-own financing options.

Customers include restaurants, bars, catering operations, and other food service establishments throughout Kentucky. The company carries equipment from brands such as Hobart, Vulcan, Manitowoc, Vollrath, and hundreds of other manufacturers.

C Worth Superstore distinguishes itself as one of Kentucky''s largest restaurant equipment suppliers, with kitchen designers who ensure efficient operation layouts and an installation team that coordinates delivery. The company also offers both new and reconditioned equipment and lease-to-own arrangements.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial kitchen design", "Equipment delivery", "Equipment installation", "Lease-to-own financing", "Restaurant equipment distribution", "Commercial refrigeration supply", "Commercial cooking equipment supply", "Smallwares supply", "Janitorial supplies supply", "Food preparation equipment supply", "Ice machine supply", "Restaurant furniture supply"], "industries": ["Restaurant", "Food service", "Catering", "Commercial kitchen", "Bar", "Hospitality"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One of Kentucky''s largest restaurant equipment suppliers", "Kitchen designers ensure efficient operation layouts", "Installation team coordinates equipment delivery", "Lease-to-own financing options available", "New and reconditioned equipment options"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1954 -> db", "Headquarters in Lexington, Kentucky -> db", "Offers commercial kitchen design, delivery, installation, lease-to-own -> /", "Carries brands like Hobart, Vulcan, Manitowoc, Vollrath -> /", "Serves restaurants, bars, catering in Kentucky -> /", "Languages: English, Spanish -> /", "One of Kentucky''s largest restaurant equipment suppliers -> /", "Kitchen designers ensure efficient operation -> /", "Installation team coordinates delivery -> /", "New and reconditioned equipment options -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "As your one-stop shop for all of your commercial kitchen and culinary needs... As one of Kentucky''s largest restaurant equipment suppliers, we''re prepared to meet your needs. We specialize in professi