UPDATE companies SET description='CBM Plastics, Inc. was founded in 2001 in Arthur, Illinois, as a family-owned and operated business.

Today the company operates as a single-source supplier for plastic components, offering custom injection molding, plastic profile extrusion, and thermoforming under one roof. In-house engineering support provides design consultation and development, while assembly and logistics services extend the offering beyond molding. The facility houses equipment for all three core processes, enabling production of a wide variety of plastic parts.

CBM Plastics serves customers across a broad range of industries, though the company does not publicly list specific sectors.

The company emphasizes a partnership model, stating that its primary goal is to empower partners to find and sustain success through effective, reliable product lines. It highlights in-house engineering as a way to save customers time and money, and promotes a single-house supplier experience backed by on-site equipment and a commitment to confidentiality and on-time delivery.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic injection molding", "Plastic profile extrusion", "Thermoforming", "Assembly", "Logistics", "Engineering design consultation"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house engineering design consultation", "Assembly and logistics support", "Single-house supplier for extrusion, injection molding, and thermoforming", "Family-owned and operated", "Emphasis on business confidentiality and on-time delivery"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2001 -> db", "Headquarters Arthur, Illinois -> db", "Family-owned and operated -> page /", "Services: custom plastic injection molding, plastic profile extrusion, thermoforming -> page /", "In-house engineering design consultation -> page /", "Assembly and logistics services -> page /", "Single-house supplier experience -> page /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "CBM Plastics is a family-owned and operated company with over 20 years of experience in the areas of profile extrusion, custom plastic injection molding, and thermoforming.", "founded_year": "2001", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/cbm-plastics/"], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='cbm-plastics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='CF Woodworks LLC operates from Marlboro Township, New Jersey, where it was founded in 2019 by Chris, who began the venture as a personal hobby. After completing his first epoxy river table, he listed it on Facebook Marketplace and sold it within days, prompting him to turn the craft into a full-time business.

The shop produces custom epoxy river tables, residential and commercial bars—including whiskey barrel bars—epoxy interior decor, charcuterie boards, wedding bouquet preservation castings, and themed serving boards. A SlabMizer mill flattens wood slabs up to 15 feet long and 55 inches wide, a capability the company notes is rare in Monmouth County. The facility also handles live-edge dining tables, benches, coasters, and other small gift items sold through an Etsy storefront.

Customers range from homeowners seeking one-of-a-kind dining pieces to hospitality operators outfitting bars and restaurants. Wedding parties commission bouquet castings, while gift buyers purchase themed boards and coasters online.

